    "title": "Waves Of Vitamin Sea Spa To Celebrate Grand Opening In Ocean County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Allentoff ,\n12 hours ago LAKEWOOD – A new wellness destination is making its debut at the Jersey Shore. Waves of Vitamin Sea Spa LLC will hold a grand opening celebration on September 28 at 1 p.m. at its location, 1875 Route 70 West in Lakewood.\nThe event will feature live music from Universal Entertainment’s DJ, complimentary mocktails, light refreshments from Cool Concessions Ice Cream Truck, and prize raffles offering spa-themed giveaways. Guests will also have the opportunity to tour the new facility, which specializes in massage therapy and facials.\nOrganizers said the spa’s mission extends beyond relaxation and self-care. One percent of every service will be donated to the 4Ocean Foundation, supporting efforts to remove plastic pollution from the world’s oceans.\nThe celebration is free and open to the public. Families and friends are encouraged to attend and take part in the festivities.\nFor more information and to pre-register, visit their Facebook Page.\n1",
